OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a dry morning with
OL,6,Fprolonged sunny spells. A little
OL,7,Fcloudier in the afternoon with bright
OL,8,For sunny intervals and showers
OL,9,Fpossible. Brisk winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FShowers this evening will
OL,12,Fclear, with a dry night following and
OL,13,Flong clear periods. Winds gradually
OL,14,Fease, but coastal areas will stay
OL,15,Ffairly breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
