OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FLargely dry during daytime
OL,6,Fwith some good sunny spells,
OL,7,Fespecially in the morning. More in the
OL,8,Fway of cloud through the afternoon
OL,9,Fahead of patchy rain arriving by
OL,10,Fevening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRather
OL,13,Fchangeable on Friday with showers or
OL,14,Flonger spells of rain, but generally
OL,15,Fdrier on the weekend with bright
OL,16,Fspells.
